# A1 (QUALIFICATION): the AUDITED attach of c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-audit (ship-prefix plus the verify audits and the gate marker; chunked prefill and packed prefix reuse with sticky sessions ON).
# READ: ZERO audit mismatches (T1, T2, extent); '[PINDIAG] packed-any admission passed' at 262144 with NO UNQUALIFIED and NO evidence-waiver line; prefix INSTALLED
# ('[PINDIAG] prefix: install sticky=1 lookahead=16 drop_last=True' and the model warm line '[PINDIAG] prefix: model warm restore_mode='); no program compiled after the warm.
# A1 and S0 run UNSALTED (the smoke sends no cache_salt): no capture, no hit, so NO 'sticky admit' line is expected here; hits are P1's and H3's job. HASHES: concurrent8_steady,
# concurrent8_code_32k and concurrent8_code_equal must be byte-equal to W1's reference hashes from W1's control attach (same prompts), per user.
# Real time: attach 18 + tests ~22.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the ship/262k-prefix pack (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over that file on a throwaway
# commit of the integration branch (with its evidence files committed) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has
# the order, stop rules, real minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10 is the ONE shipping image X0B builds: every job serves it.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k,concurrent8_code_equal
